{"id":"fa9532db07327ff3","group":"88","path":"88/88-lem-degree-partial-order.md","title":"Degree Partial Order Lemma","display":"lem-degree-partial-order — Degree Partial Order Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-lem-degree-partial-order","aliases":["88-lem-degree-partial-order"],"display":"lem-degree-partial-order — Degree Partial Order Lemma","depends_on":["[[88-df-turing-degree]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-lem-degree-partial-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-lem-degree-partial-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-degree-partial-order — Degree Partial Order Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f4ee50f99db72eec\" href=\"?note=f4ee50f99db72eec\" title=\"88-df-turing-degree\">88-df-turing-degree</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_T\">\\(\\mathcal D_T\\)</span> (class of Turing degrees, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f4ee50f99db72eec\" href=\"?note=f4ee50f99db72eec\" title=\"88-df-turing-degree\">88-df-turing-degree</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq_T\">\\(\\preceq_T\\)</span> (degree ordering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f4ee50f99db72eec\" href=\"?note=f4ee50f99db72eec\" title=\"88-df-turing-degree\">88-df-turing-degree</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}degree\\text{-}partial\\text{-}order} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D_T\\;(\\mathbf a\\preceq_T\\mathbf a)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal D_T\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathbf a\\preceq_T\\mathbf b\n\\land\\mathbf b\\preceq_T\\mathbf c\n\\to\\mathbf a\\preceq_T\\mathbf c\n\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D_T\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathbf a\\preceq_T\\mathbf b\n\\land\\mathbf b\\preceq_T\\mathbf a\n\\to\\mathbf a=\\mathbf b\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}degree\\text{-}partial\\text{-}order} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D_T\\;(\\mathbf a\\preceq_T\\mathbf a)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal D_T\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathbf a\\preceq_T\\mathbf b\n\\land\\mathbf b\\preceq_T\\mathbf c\n\\to\\mathbf a\\preceq_T\\mathbf c\n\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D_T\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathbf a\\preceq_T\\mathbf b\n\\land\\mathbf b\\preceq_T\\mathbf a\n\\to\\mathbf a=\\mathbf b\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_T\">\\(\\mathcal D_T\\)</span> : Turing度类</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq_T\">\\(\\preceq_T\\)</span> : 度之间的偏序；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_T\">\\(\\leq_T\\)</span>保留给自然数集合之间的归约。</li>\n<li>Turing度构成偏序结构</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-turing-degree","status":"resolved","id":"f4ee50f99db72eec","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-turing-degree]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-turing-degree","status":"resolved","id":"f4ee50f99db72eec","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal D_T$ (class of Turing degrees, see [[88-df-turing-degree]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-turing-degree","status":"resolved","id":"f4ee50f99db72eec","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\preceq_T$ (degree ordering, see [[88-df-turing-degree]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal D_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\preceq_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}degree\\text{-}partial\\text{-}order} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\forall\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D_T\\;(\\mathbf a\\preceq_T\\mathbf a)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal D_T\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathbf a\\preceq_T\\mathbf b\n\\land\\mathbf b\\preceq_T\\mathbf c\n\\to\\mathbf a\\preceq_T\\mathbf c\n\\bigr)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D_T\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathbf a\\preceq_T\\mathbf b\n\\land\\mathbf b\\preceq_T\\mathbf a\n\\to\\mathbf a=\\mathbf b\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal D_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\preceq_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_T","display":false}],"bytes":1146,"backlinks":[{"id":"f4ee50f99db72eec","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"代表元的选择不影响 $\\preceq_T$；其偏序性质由 [[88-lem-degree-partial-order]] 给出。"}],"outgoing":["f4ee50f99db72eec"]}